// Title: All findings
// Size: full
// Why: Every finding from every tab, most severe first. Use the grid filter to search (e.g. a PID, a path or a technique ID such as T1003).
AllFindings()
| where SeverityRank >= 1
| project Severity, Category, Finding, PID, Process, Detail, SeverityRank
| order by SeverityRank desc, Category asc, Finding asc
| project-away SeverityRank
